message: "If you use this software or these result files, please cite them as below."
title: "Auditing the NetFlow versions of IoT and enterprise intrusion detection benchmarks: data quality, shortcuts and cross-dataset evaluation"
abstract: >-
  Code, result files and partition checksums for a record-level audit of the
  NF-v2 and NF-v3 releases of NF-ToN-IoT, NF-BoT-IoT and NF-CSE-CIC-IDS2018,
  and for the in-domain, cross-dataset, replication and SHAP experiments that
  measure how their problems affect evaluation. The datasets are not included.
type: software
